WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.396
An LLM learns language patterns and predicts likely next tokens.

00:00:05.396 --> 00:00:10.792
Think of it like an extremely well-read autocomplete system using the current context.

00:00:10.792 --> 00:00:16.188
A prompt becomes tokens, the small units the model processes.

00:00:16.188 --> 00:00:21.584
Transformer layers process relationships between tokens and score possible continuations.

00:00:21.584 --> 00:00:26.980
Selected tokens are added one by one until the system stops.

00:00:26.980 --> 00:00:32.376
An LLM generates language from learned patterns and current context; fluency is not proof of truth.
